'''Sea of Tuna''' (マグロ海域 ''Maguro Kaiiki'', '''Tuna Sea Area''') is the 7th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
The hardest sub-chapter up to this point, but still only moderate in terms of difficulty. Most of the stages here are very annoying, so be prepared. The hardest levels are [[Fresh Wharf]], which spawns two [[Master A.|Master As]] at the beginning, [[Frozen Tuna Front]], which spawns 3 Master As at the beginning + other semi-tanky, yet annoying peons, and [[Cave Fillet]], a cruel stage with both [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] and [[Teacher Bun Bun]].
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Bore]]: An exceptionally powerful [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy with high stats, non-stop attacks and fairly quick movement speed. However, he has very short range. Can be treated as a much faster version of a buffed [[One Horn]] or as a stronger but slower [[Shy Boy]].

